    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 364,
    "bookid": 31,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 164,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 54370,
        "bookId": 31,
        "chapterId": 31,
        "headingId": 164,
        "headingText": "<p></p>\r\n<p>Gastric adenosquamous carcinomas develop most commonly in the lower third, followed by the upper and middle third {28676632}. Extension from the most frequent oesophagogastric junction adenosquamous carcinoma should be excluded.</p>\r\n<p></p>",
        "timestamp": "2019-01-29T16:41:54"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 365,
    "bookid": 31,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 165,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 54371,
        "bookId": 31,
        "chapterId": 31,
        "headingId": 165,
        "headingText": "<p></p>\r\n<p>The clinical features of gastric adenosquamous carcinoma are similar to those of other types of gastric cancer {21573743}. Most tumours present as large masses, with a mean size of 5&nbsp;cm {3942965; 25889482; 669198}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2019-01-29T16:42:08"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 366,
    "bookid": 31,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 166,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 54372,
        "bookId": 31,
        "chapterId": 31,
        "headingId": 166,
        "headingText": "<p></p>\r\n<p>Gastric adenosquamous carcinoma accounts for 0.25% of all gastric cancers {25567665}. Males are predominantly affected, with a mean age of 60&nbsp;years {3942965; 25889482}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2019-01-29T16:42:17"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 367,
    "bookid": 31,
    "headingType": 2,
